{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["And you shall place the parochet under the clasps — of gold, which are at the end of twenty cubits of the curtains, at the beginning of the mishkan, for the mishkan's length is thirty, and the clasps are in the middle of the forty cubits of the ten curtains. It follows that from the parochet to the eastern entrance there are twenty cubits of the heikhal, and from it westward ten cubits of the Holy of Holies."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:43:12.809278107Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}